{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"timeout-sem-zero-duration-001","description":"A zero-length time::timeout polls its inner future first, then its Sleep, at one instant. t.b waits on a semaphore t.a holds: the acquire pends, the Sleep is already due, so the step is Elapsed in the same poll and no timer was registered. t.c asks a free semaphore: the acquire completes at the deadline exactly and wins (the inner is polled before the Sleep), observed as ASX_OK.","unit":"timers","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":400},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[{"name":"held","type":"semaphore","permits":1},{"name":"free","type":"semaphore","permits":1}],"tasks":[{"name":"t.a","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sem_acquire","semaphore":"held","count":1},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"sem_release","semaphore":"held"}]},{"name":"t.b","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"yield"},{"op":"timeout","ns":0,"inner":{"op":"sem_acquire","semaphore":"held","count":1}},{"op":"trace","message":"b elapsed"}]},{"name":"t.c","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"yield"},{"op":"timeout","ns":0,"inner":{"op":"sem_acquire","semaphore":"free","count":1}},{"op":"trace","message":"c won"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
